<footer class="bg-secondary text-secondary-content">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[90rem] px-4 pt-10 md:px-10 md:pt-14">
    <div class="flex items-center text-accent" data-stitch aria-hidden="true">
      <svg class="h-20 min-w-0 flex-1"><line x1="0" y1="71.43%" x2="100%" y2="71.43%"/></svg>
      <svg class="h-20 w-52 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 144 56"><path d="M0 40 C28 40 52 40 70 30 C86 21 90 6 76 5 C62 4 58 22 74 32 C90 42 116 40 144 40"/></svg>
      <svg class="h-20 min-w-0 flex-1"><line x1="0" y1="71.43%" x2="100%" y2="71.43%"/></svg>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-14 pt-14 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-10 md:pt-20">
      <div class="md:col-span-7">
        <h2 class="text-[clamp(3rem,7vw,6.5rem)] leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.015em]">Come and <em>stay</em></h2>
        <p class="prose-linen mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg">Five rooms, a roof for breakfast and a courtyard for the evening, twelve minutes on foot from Santo Domingo. Tell us your dates and we will write back within a day.</p>
        <a href="/book#request" class="btn btn-accent mt-9">Book a room</a>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-4 md:col-start-9">
        <p class="tag text-accent">Find us</p>
        <address class="mt-5 space-y-1 not-italic">
          <span class="display block text-3xl">Calle del Telar 14</span>
          <span class="block text-secondary-content/80">Barrio de Jalatlaco, 68080 Oaxaca de Juárez, Mexico</span>
        </address>
        <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Calle+del+Telar+14+Jalatlaco+Oaxaca" class="tag mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-accent underline decoration-dashed underline-offset-[0.5em] hover:no-underline">Open in Maps <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <ul class="mt-8 space-y-2 text-lg">
          <li><a href="mailto:stay@casahilo.example" class="hover:text-accent">stay@casahilo.example</a></li>
          <li><a href="tel:+529515550142" class="hover:text-accent">+52 951 555 0142</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://wa.me/529515550142" class="hover:text-accent">WhatsApp</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-12 border-t border-secondary-content/20 pt-12 md:mt-20 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-10">
      <div class="md:col-span-6">
        <p class="tag text-accent">The courtyard letter</p>
        <p class="display mt-4 text-3xl text-balance">A letter from the courtyard, four times a year</p>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-secondary-content/80">What is in bloom on the roof, the Thursday suppers, and the weeks when a room is still free.</p>
        <form hx-post="/_data/newsletter" hx-target="this" hx-swap="outerHTML" hx-status:422="target:#newsletter-problems swap:innerHTML" class="mt-6 max-w-md">
          <label for="newsletter-email" class="tag text-secondary-content/80">Your email</label>
          <div class="mt-2 flex gap-2">
            <input id="newsletter-email" name="email" type="email" required maxlength="200" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" class="input field-indigo w-full">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-accent">Sign up</button>
          </div>
          <div id="newsletter-problems" class="mt-3"></div>
        </form>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Footer" class="md:col-span-5 md:col-start-8">
        <ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-3">
          {% for item in data.navigation %}{% unless item.place == "header" %}
          <li><a href="{{ item.href }}" class="tag text-secondary-content/85 transition-colors hover:text-accent">{{ item.label }}</a></li>
          {% endunless %}{% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-16 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-secondary-content/20 py-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.3em] uppercase">Casa Hilo</p>
      <p class="tag text-secondary-content/70">A guesthouse of five rooms · Oaxaca · since 2021</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
